#: ../../source/changelog.md:1 6edf2e89aabb4489ba233abb14bf8c5a
msgid "更新日志"
msgstr "Changelog"

#: ../../source/changelog.md:3 807cabc12d5241ad8b7f6c6c03d17f1d
msgid "2026-11-09"
msgstr "2026-11-09"

#: ../../source/changelog.md:5 2f1736b863004a3cb069dc3143bbe679
msgid "核心更改"
msgstr "Core Changes"

#: ../../source/changelog.md:7 fab37fd442a2451ba21172d45c317fb0
msgid "**文档体系全面重构**：重新规划文档导航与层级结构，解耦面向使用的「用户指南」与面向进阶开发的「开发者指南」，显著提升检索效率。"
msgstr ""
"**Comprehensive Documentation Restructuring**: Redesigned documentation "
"navigation and hierarchy, decoupling the usage-focused \"User Guides\" "
"from the advanced \"Developer Guides\" to significantly improve retrieval"
" efficiency."

#: ../../source/changelog.md:8 37a8842c973c4f8f8285a61069cb48d7
msgid ""
"**模型库与数据集目录体系化**：收录 60+ 个经典与前沿 KT 模型并建立独立文档，系统梳理 14+ 个主流公开数据集规范及统一的五步 ETL"
" 数据管线。"
msgstr ""
"**Systematic Model Zoo and Dataset Catalog**: Integrated 60+ classic and "
"cutting-edge KT models with dedicated pages, alongside systematic "
"coverage of 14+ mainstream public dataset specifications and a unified "
"5-step ETL pipeline."

#: ../../source/changelog.md:9 5dc57a22455a422ba09eea20b7355d08
msgid "**新增基准评测与排行榜板块**：上线统一评测板块，引入交互式竞技场排行榜、标准化 5 折学生级交叉验证协议及模型吞吐与推理效率基准。"
msgstr ""
"**New Benchmark Suite and Leaderboard**: Launched a unified evaluation "
"section featuring an interactive arena leaderboard, standardized 5-fold "
"student-level cross-validation protocol, and model throughput/inference "
"efficiency benchmarks."

#: ../../source/changelog.md:10 5eb300a0f60e4cbea724dc8b45b58f9d
msgid ""
"**完善 CLI 命令行与 API 参考手册**：补齐训练、数据处理、Optuna 调参、K "
"折交叉验证、案例分析等核心命令的使用手册与常用速查表，规范 Python 接口参考。"
msgstr ""
"**Enhanced CLI and API Reference Manuals**: Added comprehensive guides "
"and quick cheatsheets for core commands including training, data "
"processing, Optuna tuning, K-fold cross-validation, and case analysis, "
"standardizing Python API references."

#: ../../source/changelog.md:11 34a6ae0d05ed4b9cba8886ce679fa0c0
msgid "**品牌视觉与交互体验升级**：上线 UniKT 专属字标与图标，深度定制 Furo 明暗双色主题、侧边栏二级折叠导航及移动端响应式布局。"
msgstr ""
"**Brand Identity and UX Upgrades**: Introduced the official UniKT "
"wordmark and icon, with deeply customized Furo light/dark dual themes, "
"collapsible two-level sidebar navigation, and responsive mobile layouts."

#: ../../source/changelog.md:13 ef7caf818d1446eeb8ff8e58aabe439b
msgid "其他细节"
msgstr "Other Improvements"

#: ../../source/changelog.md:15 d0596047dcc943b0876e92d58bc5e279
msgid "首页改版为直观的知识追踪工作流示意图与基准概览入口。"
msgstr ""
"Revamped the home page with an intuitive knowledge tracing workflow "
"diagram and benchmark overview entry points."

#: ../../source/changelog.md:16 9e59ec3b2dbe49aea776290f76b9ac3c
msgid "构建工作流收敛，将多语言构建与维护命令从 Makefile 统一迁移至 Pixi 的 `doc-i18n-*` 任务流。"
msgstr ""
"Consolidated build workflows by migrating the multi-language build and "
"maintenance commands from the Makefile to Pixi's `doc-i18n-*` task flow."

#: ../../source/changelog.md:17 7daf7d1d10f8422ba64538d26e0b4b1d
msgid "优化表格横向滚动、代码块与提示框间距排版，修复搜索框边框细节并清理历史过时文档。"
msgstr ""
"Optimized table horizontal scrolling, code block and callout spacing, "
"polished search bar border details, and purged deprecated documentation."
